The Tactus prototype supplied beat-framing and time-conversion compatibility
with the QM Vamp plugin. Vamp itself is neither included nor required.
No models or weights are used. Algorithm fidelity does not guarantee musical accuracy.

patches/dlamch-native-warning.patch replaces only the legacy Fortran warning
output with stderr; numerical calculations are unchanged and libf2c is not required.

patches/segmenter-free-mfcc.patch adds the missing MFCC destructor call to
ClusterMeltSegmenter. This changes allocation cleanup only.
